# No password needed here anymore -- Garage replaced MinIO (see
# docker-compose.yml's comment on the `garage` service for why), and its
# RPC secret is auto-generated and persisted by garage-entrypoint.sh on
# first run instead of being a user-managed credential.

# Must be the Docker host's real LAN IP or hostname, not "localhost" --
# unless you'll only ever open the web app from the Docker host itself.
# This gets baked into the web app at build time, so "localhost" would
# resolve to whichever machine the browser runs on, not the Docker host.
# Note the /collections path: nginx (see nginx-web.conf) proxies that to
# Garage internally, since Garage's public-read mechanism needs a Host
# header the browser's bare IP can't provide on its own.
# Example: PROXYNEXUS_COLLECTIONS_URL=http://192.168.1.50:8050/collections
PROXYNEXUS_COLLECTIONS_URL=http://IP or HOSTNAME:8050/collections
